C('n, m = 3, 4\nx, y = 0, 3\nfor dx, dy in [(1, 0), (-1, 0), (0, 1), (0, -1)]:\n    nx, ny = x + dx, y + dy\n    if 0 <= nx < n and 0 <= ny < m:\n        print(nx, ny)'),
